4	// Session-transcript parsing for conversation-surface rules (Stop hook only —
5	// CI has no transcript, so rules must return [] when ctx.conversation() is null).
6	// A Claude Code transcript is JSONL; the shapes this reads were verified against
7	// a real session file, not inferred: an owner turn is `type: "user"` with plain
8	// string message content (tool results arrive as content arrays, injected/meta
9	// turns carry isMeta, subagent traffic carries isSidechain, and synthetic turns
10	// — hook output, reminders, webhook activity — are tag-wrapped, starting with "<").
